      "message": "Be careful:\n\nWhen you add a BUILD file here (and in tools/testing/kselftests), the glob() expression in //common will stop globbing files in this directory. That is, when one builds kernels in common/, all files in tools/testing will be excluded (including makefiles, etc., if there are any)\n\nIs this what you want?\n\n--\n\nEDIT: Note that the \"kernel_aarch64_allmodconfig\" target is broken exactly because of this. You might need to exclude kselftests in allmodconfig targets.",
