      "message": "Please, use a proper rule, not a genrule.\n\ngo/kleaf-no-genrule\n\nAt the bare minimum, at least replace it with hermetic_genrule. (Though in your case, you are only using `echo`, so it is technically not breaking hermeticity.) \n\nI strongly recommend to not even use hermetic_genrule, but a proper rule().\n\nAlso, when defining the rule, perhaps put the rule definition in build/kernel/kleaf so it can be reused in other branches. This rule looks generic enough (it just dumps paths of all of its sources) that it can be used elsewhere.",
